Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,Absolutely, robots are the\Nbig thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.72,0:00:04.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,So robots have affected a\Nlot of other parts of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:05.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:08.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,but in shoulders and joints,\Ntotal hips and knees,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:10.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,there's actually been not a\Nlot of science
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:13.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,to say robots are the next\Npanacea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:15.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,And we all think of going to\Na surgeon that does robots,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:17.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's a great marketing tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:20.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,but ultimately you're not\Nsolving a simple problem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:22.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,and you're not adding\Nanything beneficial to the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:23.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:26.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,From my side of therapy,\Nrobotic procedures,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:27.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,especially in the knee and\Nthe hip,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:32.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I've seen worse outcomes\Nthan a doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:34.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,that actually knows the\Nanomalies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:37.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,where the robot knows\Nexactly what to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:40.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't always know\Nwhat not to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:43.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, that was a really\Nprofound statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:48.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's actually a modern\Ndilemma, right?
